        "right": "*pp"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_second_cached_stab_decode_ptr_reaches_addr_read",
      "fine_trace_step": 13,
      "description": "ASan crash site. `H5F_addr_decode_len()` blindly reads the next byte of an address from `*pp`. On the second cached-STAB address decode, that byte read lands just past the heap-backed 164-byte superblock image."
    },
